  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **don't get too close to my fantasy**: back after 77 archived shows (763 days) [3]\n- **back 2 basom**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **roses r free**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **tooter**: back after 139 archived shows (1189 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **molluskocean man**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **jam w/ bernie worell**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **booze me up**: back after 151 archived shows (1221 days) [3]\n- **buenas tardes**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-9-26_greektheater_berkeley_flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 30 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the Matrix recording great sounding; Uploader says the recording has a nice stereo image [1][2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Attendance was sparse, so there was no queue for beer [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-9-26_greektheater_berkeley_flac16**: taped by david barfield; transferred by david barfield; source: schoeps mk4/cmc6 (x/y 90deg @ 12' @ sbd) > zoalla silver > minime (16/44) > m1 [1]. Also: File order is wrong in the upload: the first four files should be the last four; setlist is correct [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [Ween Flyer](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/WeenGreek_Blue.html) [4]",
